                  "text": "Agai 2:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Akiroit be “nabo” idodiunit dir atamar itamaranikinio ngiboro lu asubitae tolemarae, sodi ani ngiboro lu nyitamaranikinio, kidongo.",
          "type": "text",
